 brain? Obesity drugs get a makeover for addiction and depression</p>\n                            <p><span>News</span> <span><time datetime=\"2026-10-13\">13 OCT 26</time></span></p>\n                        </a>\n                    </li>","sentences":[{"en":"Can GLP-1s heal the brain?","zh":null},{"en":"Obesity drugs get a makeover for addiction and depression News 13 OCT 26","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>Can GLP-1s heal the brain? Obesity drugs get a makeover for addiction and depression</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Can GLP-1s heal the brain?","zh":null},{"en":"Obesity drugs get a makeover for addiction and depression","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p><span>News</span> <span><time datetime=\"2026-10-13\">13 OCT 26</time></span></p>","sentences":[{"en":"News 13 OCT 26","zh":null}]}],"translated":true,"content_html_zh":"<div class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"content\" data-container-type=\"article\" data-component=\"article-container\">\n            \n                \n            \n\n            \n\n            <article data-track-component=\"news\" lang=\"en\">\n                \n                <div>\n                    \n                        <div>\n    <header>\n        <div>\n            <ul data-test=\"article-identifier\">\n                \n                    <li data-test=\"article-category\">自然播客</li>\n                    <li>19 October 2026</li>\n                \n                \n            </ul>\n\n            \n\n            <div>\n                \n                <p>Although worries are growing about AI's potential to blunt reasoning skills, research has uncovered ways to keep the brain sharp.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n            <div>\n                \n                    <p><span>By</span></p><ul data-test=\"authors-list\" data-component-authors-activator=\"authors-list\">\n    \n        \n        <li>Helen Pearson &amp;</li>\n    \n        \n        <li>本杰明·汤普森</li>\n    \n</ul>\n\n\n<div data-test=\"author-info\">\n    <ol>\n        \n            <li>Helen Pearson</li>\n        \n            <li>本杰明·汤普森</li>\n        \n    </ol>\n</div>\n\n                \n            </div>\n        \n    </header>\n\n    \n    <div>\n        \n\n            <nav aria-label=\"Subscription links\">\n                <div data-test=\"dropdown-podcast\">\n                    <p>订阅</p>\n                </div>\n            </nav>\n    </div>\n    \n        \n    \n\n    \n</div>\n                    \n\n                    \n\n                    \n                        \n                            \n                        \n                        \n                        <div data-nosnippet=\"\" data-test=\"main-content\">\n                            <div><p data-cc-video=\"full\"><iframe data-src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/zMqjkTx1nE8?enablejsapi=1\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Audio long read: How to stay smart in the age of AI — the science of critical thinking\" id=\"player-zMqjkTx1nE8\" data-youtube-id=\"zMqjkTx1nE8\" data-component-youtube-video=\"true\"></iframe></p></div><p>Download the October 2026 long read podcast</p><p>Critical thinking is a skill that is under threat from the AI revolution in large language models. But all is not lost. Specialists in education and cognition have long been studying critical thinking, and some have useful tips on how to stay cognitively sharp in the age of AI.</p><p>This is an audio version of our Feature: How to stay smart in the age of AI: the science of critical thinking</p><p>不错过任何一集。 在 Apple Podcasts、Spotify、YouTube Music 或您最喜欢的播客应用程序上订阅 Nature Podcast。 Nature Podcast 的 RSS 提要也可用。</p>\n                        </div>\n                    \n                        <p>doi: https://doi.org/10.1038/d41586-026-03228-3</p>\n\n                    \n                    \n\n                    \n                        \n    <div data-test=\"related-articles-list\">\n    \n    \n        <h2 data